        <span class="badge-fail" style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px">E Security Boundary</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Evaluates whether the agent responds appropriately to detected threats via block, escalate, or abort</strong>.<br>No-response penalty of 0.5. The combination of threat detection + inappropriate response is the highest risk scenario.<br>Use with ThreatSeverityConfig to complete the detection-response pair.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text"><code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">score_clean_tasks=True</code> assigns a base score even to clean tasks. no_response_penalty=0.5 default imposes a strong penalty for non-response.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 threat_response=ThreatResponseConfig(
  score_clean_tasks=True,
  no_response_penalty=0.5)</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Response rate 100% Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 70–99% Caution</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;70% Critical</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /gE config grid -->
  </div><!-- /harness gE -->

  <!-- ── Harness Config 지표 — Gate F ── -->
  <div x-show="mf==='all'||mf==='gF'">
  <div class="sdiv" style="margin-bottom:12px"><div class="sdiv-line"></div><span class="sdiv-lbl">Harness Config — Additional Criteria (4)<span class="grp-chip grp-F">F Multi-Agent</span></span><div class="sdiv-line"></div></div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(360px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px">

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">🤝</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">ConsensusConfig — Consensus Quality</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Multi-agent consensus quality · F</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.15);color:#8b5cf6;font-weight:600">F Multi-Agent</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Choose the consensus method: majority vote, weighted consensus, or unanimous agreement.</strong><br>Per-agent weights reflect expertise. Suited for ensemble agent evaluation with <code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:0 3px;border-radius:2px">batch_eval</code>.<br>Consensus failure (exceeding disagreement_threshold) signals excessive model diversity.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text">Use consensus_method="weighted" to prioritize expert agents. Set agent_weights={"expert": 3.0} to weight domain-expert agents higher.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 consensus=ConsensusConfig(
  consensus_method="weighted",
  agent_weights={"expert":3.0})</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Consensus ≥85% Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 60–84% Good</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;60% Redesign needed</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">📡</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">PropagationConfig — Information Propagation</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Inter-agent information propagation fidelity · F</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.15);color:#8b5cf6;font-weight:600">F Multi-Agent</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Measures whether key facts from the source agent are preserved in downstream agent responses</strong>.<br>Penalizes distortion and omission. Detects information-loss paths in the pipeline.<br>Suited for tracking per-stage information retention in pipelines with 3 or more stages.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text"><code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">penalize_distortion=True</code> detects factual distortion during summarization. Register immutable facts such as dates and numbers in key_facts.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 propagation=PropagationConfig(
  key_facts=["deadline:2026-04-30"],
  penalize_distortion=True)</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Retention ≥90% Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 70–89% Good</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;70% Info lost</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">👥</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">AgentRoleConfig — Role Compliance</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Agent role compliance measurement · F</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.15);color:#8b5cf6;font-weight:600">F Multi-Agent</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Measures role boundary compliance by configuring allowed/forbidden tools and behavior keywords per role.</strong><br>Deducts 0.3 on role violation (adjustable). Suited for gating CrewAI/AutoGen multi-agent pipelines.<br>Extends the Principle of Least Privilege (PoLP) to the agent role level.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text">Auto-detects role violations such as a researcher role calling write/delete tools. Adjust <code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">role_violation_penalty=0.3</code> to reflect violation severity.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 agent_role=AgentRoleConfig(
  role_name="researcher",
  allowed_tools=["search","read"])</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Role compliant 100% Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 1 violation Warning</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 ≥2 policy violations</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">⚖️</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">ConflictResolutionConfig — Conflict Resolution</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Inter-agent conflict detection &amp; resolution · F</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.15);color:#8b5cf6;font-weight:600">F Multi-Agent</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Detects conflict markers (disagree, contradiction), then checks for resolution markers (resolved, consensus).</strong><br>Unresolved conflicts incur a 0.5 penalty. Configures whether escalation is mandatory.<br>Detects surges in unresolved conflict rates when multiple agents fail to reach the same conclusion.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text"><code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">check_resolution_quality=True</code> scores the resolution quality as well. expect_escalation_on_fail=True forces escalation to a mediator agent.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 conflict_resolution=ConflictResolutionConfig(
  check_resolution_quality=True,
  expect_escalation_on_fail=True)</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Resolution ≥90% Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 70–89% Good</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;70% Needs Improvement</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /gF config grid -->
  </div><!-- /harness gF -->

  <!-- ── Harness Config 지표 — Gate G ── -->
  <div x-show="mf==='all'||mf==='gG'">
  <div class="sdiv" style="margin-bottom:12px"><div class="sdiv-line"></div><span class="sdiv-lbl">Harness Config — Additional Criteria (4)<span class="grp-chip grp-G">G Observability</span></span><div class="sdiv-line"></div></div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(360px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px">

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #06b6d4">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">🔭</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">ObservabilityConfig — Observability</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Trace completeness &amp; audit SLO · G</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.15);color:#06b6d4;font-weight:600">G Observability</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Configures required span attribute presence (task_id, task_type, execution_time), trace continuity, and audit event SLO</strong>.<br>Warns when minimum coverage falls below 95%.<br>Pre-validates trace quality before integrating with external monitoring (Phoenix, DataDog, Grafana, etc.).
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text"><code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">audit_events=["tool_call","security_check"]</code> enforces mandatory security audit events. Set min_coverage=0.99 to detect uninstrumented gaps.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 observability=ObservabilityConfig(
  min_coverage=0.99,
  audit_events=["tool_call","security_check"])</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Coverage ≥99% Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 95–98% Good</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;95% Needs Improvement</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #06b6d4">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">💡</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">ExplainabilityConfig — Explainability</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Response explainability requirement · G</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.15);color:#06b6d4;font-weight:600">G Observability</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Scores the presence of reasoning markers (because, therefore), uncertainty expressions (may, uncertain), and citation markers</strong>.<br>Suited for compliance in high-explainability domains such as healthcare and law.<br>Automatically validates EU AI Act explainability requirements for high-risk AI systems.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text"><code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">require_uncertainty=True</code> encourages the model to express uncertainty in uncertain areas. require_citations=True enforces RAG citations.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 explainability=ExplainabilityConfig(
  require_reasoning=True,
  require_citations=True)</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Explanation score ≥0.8 Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 0.5–0.79 Good</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;0.5 Needs Improvement</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #06b6d4">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">🔍</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">ErrorDiagnosisConfig — Error Diagnosis</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Error diagnosis quality measurement · G</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.15);color:#06b6d4;font-weight:600">G Observability</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Weighted evaluation of whether failed responses include error acknowledgment (0.3), root cause (0.5), and alternative suggestion (0.2)</strong>.<br><code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:0 3px;border-radius:2px">only_on_failure=True</code> skips successful tasks.<br>Automatically measures the quality difference between "An error occurred" and "Failed because X — try Y instead".
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text">root_cause_weight=0.5 places high weight on root-cause analysis capability. <code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">only_on_failure=True</code> recommended to focus analysis on failure cases.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 error_diagnosis=ErrorDiagnosisConfig(
  only_on_failure=True,
  root_cause_weight=0.5)</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Diagnosis score ≥0.8 Excellent</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 0.5–0.79 Good</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 &lt;0.5 Needs Improvement</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi" style="padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #06b6d4">
      <div class="row-between">
        <div class="hstack"><span class="icon-lg">⏱️</span>
          <div><div class="val-sm">LatencyAttributionConfig — Latency Attribution</div>
          <div class="text-muted">Latency cause analysis · G</div></div>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.15);color:#06b6d4;font-weight:600">G Observability</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.07);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong>Decomposes total latency into tool, model, network, and unattributed components.</strong><br>Warns when tool latency exceeds 60% or unattributed latency exceeds 30%.<br>Identifies bottleneck segments to help prioritize optimization.
      </div>
      <details class="mb-2"><summary class="toggle-text">ℹ️ Usage Tips</summary>
        <div class="hint-text">High tool latency ratio: optimize with external API caching or batching. High unattributed ratio: check for uninstrumented gaps — recommended to use alongside ObservabilityConfig.</div>
      </details>
      <div class="code-hint">📐 latency_attribution=LatencyAttributionConfig(
  max_tool_time_ratio=0.6,
  max_unattributed_ratio=0.3)</div>
      <div class="flex-wrap-5">
        <span class="badge-pass">🟢 Unattributed &lt;20% Precise</span>
        <span style="font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600">🟡 20–29% Instrumentation recommended</span>
        <span class="badge-fail">🔴 ≥30% Instrumentation incomplete</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /gG config grid -->
  </div><!-- /harness gG -->

  </div><!-- /x-data mf -->
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════ SETTINGS ═══════════════ -->
<section id="s-settings" class="sec" x-show="sec==='settings'" x-cloak
         x-effect="if(sec==='settings') { loadSettings() }">
  <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px">⚙️ Settings</div>

  <!-- Deployment Thresholds -->
  <div class="sdiv"><div class="sdiv-lbl">Deployment Threshold Settings</div><div class="sdiv-line"></div></div>
  <div class="kpi" style="margin-bottom:16px">
    <!-- Presets -->
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <span class="dk" style="font-size:11px;flex-shrink:0">Preset:</span>
      <button class="btn" @click="applyPreset('default')"
              style="font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;background:var(--bg2)">Default</button>
      <button class="btn" @click="applyPreset('strict')"
              style="font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.4);color:var(--red)">Strict</button>
      <button class="btn" @click="applyPreset('relaxed')"
              style="font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);border-color:rgba(34,197,94,.4);color:var(--green)">Relaxed</button>
      <span class="dk" style="font-size:11px;margin-left:6px">TCR≥ Default 90% · Strict 95% · Relaxed 80% / accuracy·hallucination·latency·cost applied together</span>
    </div>
    <div class="drow" style="align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px">
      <span class="dk" style="width:160px;flex-shrink:0">Min TCR (%)</span>
      <input type="range" x-model.number="settingsData.tcr_min" min="50" max="100" step="1" style="flex:1">
      <span style="width:50px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:13px" x-text="settingsData.tcr_min+'%'"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="drow" style="align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px">
      <span class="dk" style="width:160px;flex-shrink:0">Min Accuracy (%)</span>
      <input type="range" x-model.number="settingsData.acc_min" min="30" max="100" step="1" style="flex:1">
      <span style="width:50px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:13px" x-text="settingsData.acc_min+'%'"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="drow" style="align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px">
      <span class="dk" style="width:160px;flex-shrink:0">Max Hallucination (%)</span>
      <input type="range" x-model.number="settingsData.hall_max" min="0" max="50" step="1" style="flex:1">
      <span style="width:50px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:13px" x-text="settingsData.hall_max+'%'"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="drow" style="align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px">
      <span class="dk" style="width:160px;flex-shrink:0">Max P95 Latency (s)</span>
      <input type="range" x-model.number="settingsData.p95_max" min="0.5" max="30" step="0.5" style="flex:1">
      <span style="width:50px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:13px" x-text="settingsData.p95_max+'s'"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="drow" style="align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px">
      <span class="dk" style="width:160px;flex-shrink:0">Max Cost ($/task)</span>
      <input type="range" x-model.number="settingsData.cost_max" min="0.001" max="0.5" step="0.001" style="flex:1">
      <span style="width:60px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:13px" x-text="'$'+settingsData.cost_max.toFixed(3)"></span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
      <button class="btn" @click="saveSettings()" :disabled="settingsSaving"
              x-text="settingsSaving ? 'Saving…' : 'Save Settings'"></button>
      <span x-show="settingsSaved" class="badge-ok">✅ Saved</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Webhook Test -->
  <div class="sdiv"><div class="sdiv-lbl">Webhook Test</div><div class="sdiv-line"></div></div>
  <div class="kpi">
    <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
      <div class="dk" style="font-size:11px;margin-bottom:4px">Webhook URL (https://)</div>
      <input x-model="webhookUrl" placeholder="https://hooks.slack.com/services/…"
             style="width:100%;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg2);color:var(--text);font-size:12px;box-sizing:border-box">
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom:12px">
      <div class="dk" style="font-size:11px;margin-bottom:4px">Payload (JSON)</div>
      <textarea x-model="webhookPayload" rows="3"
                style="width:100%;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg2);color:var(--text);font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;resize:vertical;box-sizing:border-box"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
      <button class="btn" @click="testWebhook()" :disabled="!webhookUrl || webhookLoading"
              x-text="webhookLoading ? 'Sending…' : 'Test Send'"></button>
      <template x-if="webhookResult">
        <span :class="webhookResult.ok ? 'badge-ok' : 'badge-ng'"
              x-text="webhookResult.ok ? '✅ HTTP ' + webhookResult.status : '❌ ' + (webhookResult.error||('HTTP '+webhookResult.status))"></span>
      </template>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Phase 1-C  멀티턴 대화 평가
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="s-conversation" class="sec" x-show="sec==='conversation'" x-cloak>
  <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px">💬 Multi-turn Conversation Evaluation</div>
  <div style="color:var(--text2);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:16px">ConversationSession-based context retention · topic coherence · progressive depth · session completion measurement</div>

  <template x-if="!convData || !convData.session_count">
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:48px;color:var(--text2)">
      <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px">💬</div>
      <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px">No multi-turn conversation data</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px">Record conversations using the <code>monitor.conversation("session_id")</code> context manager in the SDK.</div>
    </div>
  </template>

  <template x-if="convData && convData.session_count > 0">
    <div x-data="{
      convSelK: null,
      convMeta: {
        session_count:          {label:'Sessions',     unit:'',   desc:'Number of ConversationSessions included in this evaluation. Each session is an independent multi-turn conversation.'},
        avg_overall_score:      {label:'Avg Overall Score', unit:'%', desc:'Simple average of 4 metrics: context retention, topic coherence, progressive depth, and session completion. Since session completion is a structural metric (response length ratio), a high completion score can partially raise the overall score even when context and coherence are low. Check context, coherence, and depth together for conversation quality.'},
        avg_turns:              {label:'Avg Turns',    unit:'',   desc:'Average number of turns per session (1 user utterance + 1 agent response = 1 turn). More turns indicate deeper conversations.'},
        avg_context_retention:  {label:'Context Retention', unit:'%', desc:'Measures how well the agent retains prior conversation context. Higher scores indicate the agent better remembers and uses earlier content.'},
        avg_topic_coherence:    {label:'Topic Coherence', unit:'%', desc:'Degree to which the topic remains consistent throughout the conversation. Higher when there are no abrupt topic changes or off-topic responses.'},
        avg_progressive_depth:  {label:'Progressive Depth', unit:'%', desc:'Degree to which understanding and responses deepen as the conversation progresses. Higher when depth increases without repetition or shallow answers.'},
        avg_session_completion: {label:'Session Completion', unit:'%', desc:'Structural completeness metric measured as last response length / avg response length. Indicates whether responses were cut off abnormally, unrelated to conversation quality (context retention, topic coherence). High completion does not imply good conversation quality.'},
        avg_response_latency:   {label:'Avg Response Latency', unit:'s', desc:'Average time the agent takes to generate a response per turn. Lower values indicate faster responsiveness.'},
      },
      convFormula(k, d) {
        const ss = d.sessions || [], n = ss.length || 1;
        const sm = d.summary || {};
        if (k === 'session_count')         return `Sessions = ${d.session_count}\nTotal turns = ${ss.reduce((a,s)=>a+(s.turn_count||0),0)}`;
        if (k === 'avg_overall_score')     return `avg_overall_score = avg(overall_score)\n= ${(sm.avg_overall_score*100||0).toFixed(1)}%\n\nWeighted sum:\n  Context Retention × 0.30\n  Topic Coherence   × 0.30\n  Progressive Depth × 0.20\n  Session Completion× 0.20`;
        if (k === 'avg_turns')             return `avg_turns = avg(turn_count)\n= ${(sm.avg_turns||0).toFixed(1)} turns`;
        if (k === 'avg_context_retention') return `avg_context_retention = avg(context_retention)\n= ${(sm.avg_context_retention*100||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
        if (k === 'avg_topic_coherence')   return `avg_topic_coherence = avg(topic_coherence)\n= ${(sm.avg_topic_coherence*100||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
        if (k === 'avg_progressive_depth') return `avg_progressive_depth = avg(progressive_depth)\n= ${(sm.avg_progressive_depth*100||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
        if (k === 'avg_session_completion')return `avg_session_completion = avg(session_completion)\n= ${(sm.avg_session_completion*100||0).toFixed(1)}%\n\n⚠ Structural completeness only\n  min(1.0, last_response_len / avg_response_len)\n\nUnrelated to conversation quality (context/coherence):\n  Can be 1.0 even when context/coherence = 0`;
        if (k === 'avg_response_latency')  return `avg_response_latency = avg(avg_turn_latency)\n= ${(sm.avg_response_latency||0).toFixed(3)}s`;
        return '';
      },
      convItems(k, d) {
        const ss = d.sessions || [];
        if (k === 'session_count')          return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(b.turn_count||0)-(a.turn_count||0));
        if (k === 'avg_overall_score')      return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(a.metrics?.overall_score||0)-(b.metrics?.overall_score||0));
        if (k === 'avg_turns')              return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(b.turn_count||0)-(a.turn_count||0));
        if (k === 'avg_context_retention')  return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(a.metrics?.context_retention||0)-(b.metrics?.context_retention||0));
        if (k === 'avg_topic_coherence')    return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(a.metrics?.topic_coherence||0)-(b.metrics?.topic_coherence||0));
        if (k === 'avg_progressive_depth')  return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(a.metrics?.progressive_depth||0)-(b.metrics?.progressive_depth||0));
        if (k === 'avg_session_completion') return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(a.metrics?.session_completion||0)-(b.metrics?.session_completion||0));
        if (k === 'avg_response_latency')   return [...ss].sort((a,b)=>(b.metrics?.avg_turn_latency||0)-(a.metrics?.avg_turn_latency||0));
        return ss;
      },
      convCol3Label(k) {
        return {
          session_count:'Turns', avg_overall_score:'Overall', avg_turns:'Turns',
          avg_context_retention:'Context', avg_topic_coherence:'Coherence',
          avg_progressive_depth:'Depth', avg_session_completion:'Completion',
          avg_response_latency:'Latency'
        }[k] || 'Overall Score';
      },
      convCol3Val(k, s) {
        if (k === 'session_count' || k === 'avg_turns') return (s.turn_count||0)+' turns';
        if (k === 'avg_overall_score')      return ((s.metrics?.overall_score||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%';
        if (k === 'avg_context_retention')  return ((s.metrics?.context_retention||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%';
        if (k === 'avg_topic_coherence')    return ((s.metrics?.topic_coherence||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%';
        if (k === 'avg_progressive_depth')  return ((s.metrics?.progressive_depth||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%';
        if (k === 'avg_session_completion') return ((s.metrics?.session_completion||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%';
        if (k === 'avg_response_latency')   return (s.metrics?.avg_turn_latency||0).toFixed(3)+'s';
        return ((s.metrics?.overall_score||0)*100).toFixed(1)+'%';
      },
      convCol3Color(k, s) {
        if (k === 'session_count' || k === 'avg_turns') return 'var(--text2)';
        if (k === 'avg_response_latency') {
          const v = s.metrics?.avg_turn_latency||0;
          return v>5?'var(--red)':v>2?'var(--yellow)':'var(--green)';
        }
        const pct = k==='avg_overall_score'?(s.metrics?.overall_score||0)*100
                  : k==='avg_context_retention'?(s.metrics?.context_retention||0)*100
                  : k==='avg_topic_coherence'?(s.metrics?.topic_coherence||0)*100
                  : k==='avg_progressive_depth'?(s.metrics?.progressive_depth||0)*100
                  : (s.metrics?.session_completion||0)*100;
        return pct>=70?'var(--green)':pct>=40?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)';
      }
    }">
      <!-- KPI 카드 -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='session_count'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='session_count'?null:'session_count'">
          <div class="text-muted">Sessions</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="convData.session_count"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_overall_score'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_overall_score'?null:'avg_overall_score'">
          <div class="text-muted">Avg Overall Score</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_overall_score*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_turns'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_turns'?null:'avg_turns'">
          <div class="text-muted">Avg Turns</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_turns||0).toFixed(1)"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_context_retention'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_context_retention'?null:'avg_context_retention'">
          <div class="text-muted">Context Retention</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_context_retention*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_topic_coherence'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_topic_coherence'?null:'avg_topic_coherence'">
          <div class="text-muted">Topic Coherence</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_topic_coherence*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_progressive_depth'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_progressive_depth'?null:'avg_progressive_depth'">
          <div class="text-muted">Progressive Depth</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_progressive_depth*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_session_completion'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_session_completion'?null:'avg_session_completion'">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px">
            <span class="text-muted">Session Completion</span>
            <span title="Structural completeness only — unrelated to conversation quality" style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg3);border-radius:99px;padding:0 5px;cursor:help;flex-shrink:0">structural</span>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_session_completion*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:convSelK==='avg_response_latency'}" @click="convSelK=convSelK==='avg_response_latency'?null:'avg_response_latency'">
          <div class="text-muted">Avg Response Latency</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(convData.summary?.avg_response_latency||0).toFixed(2)+'s'"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- KPI 상세 패널 -->
      <div x-show="convSelK" style="margin:0 0 14px;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden" x-cloak>
        <template x-if="convSelK">
          <div>
            <div class="panel-header">
              <span class="val-md" x-text="convMeta[convSelK]?.label||convSelK"></span>
              <span class="tag-sm" x-text="convMeta[convSelK]?.unit?'Unit: '+convMeta[convSelK].unit:''"></span>
              <button class="btn-close" @click="convSelK=null">×</button>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-2-divider">
              <div class="panel-bg2-r">
                <div class="label-upper">Description</div>
                <div class="body-text" x-text="convMeta[convSelK]?.desc||''"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="panel-bg3">
                <div class="label-upper">📐 Calculation</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-line" x-text="convFormula(convSelK, convData)"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-bg">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
                <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase">Related Sessions</span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-left:auto" x-text="convItems(convSelK, convData).length+' sessions'"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="dtx" style="max-height:220px;overflow-y:auto">
                <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(140px,1fr) 80px 72px 72px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
                  <span>Session ID</span>
                  <span x-text="convCol3Label(convSelK)"></span>
                  <span>Completion</span>
                  <span>Context</span>
                </div>
                <template x-for="s in convItems(convSelK, convData)" :key="s.session_id">
                  <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(140px,1fr) 80px 72px 72px">
                    <span class="dtx-id" x-text="s.session_id"></span>
                    <span :style="`color:${convCol3Color(convSelK, s)}`" x-text="convCol3Val(convSelK, s)"></span>
                    <span :style="`color:${(s.metrics?.session_completion||0)>=0.9?'var(--green)':(s.metrics?.session_completion||0)>=0.6?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
                          x-text="((s.metrics?.session_completion||0)*100).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
                    <span :style="`color:${(s.metrics?.context_retention||0)>=0.7?'var(--green)':(s.metrics?.context_retention||0)>=0.4?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
                          x-text="((s.metrics?.context_retention||0)*100).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
                  </div>
                </template>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>

      <!-- 세션 목록 (KPI 카드 미선택 시에만 표시) -->
      <div x-show="!convSelK" class="kpi" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
        <div style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">Session List</div>
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px">
          <thead><tr style="background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2)">
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:left">Session ID</th>
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center">Turns</th>
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center">Overall</th>
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center">Context</th>
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center">Coherence</th>
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center">Depth</th>
            <th style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center">Completion</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <template x-for="s in (convData.sessions||[])" :key="s.session_id">
              <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer"
                  @click="convSelected=(convSelected===s.session_id?null:s.session_id)"
                  :style="convSelected===s.session_id?'background:var(--bg3)':''">
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)" x-text="s.session_id"></td>
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center" x-text="s.turn_count"></td>
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center;font-weight:700" x-text="(s.metrics?.overall_score*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center" x-text="(s.metrics?.context_retention*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center" x-text="(s.metrics?.topic_coherence*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center" x-text="(s.metrics?.progressive_depth*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
                <td style="padding:7px 12px;text-align:center" x-text="(s.metrics?.session_completion*100||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
              </tr>
              <template x-if="convSelected===s.session_id">
                <tr><td colspan="7" style="padding:0;background:var(--bg3)">
                  <div style="padding:12px 16px">
                    <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--accent)">Turn Details</div>
                    <template x-for="(turn, ti) in (s.turns||[])" :key="ti">
                      <div style="background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:8px">
                        <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px" x-text="'Turn '+(ti+1)"></div>
                        <div style="margin-bottom:6px"><span style="color:var(--text2);font-size:11px">USER: </span><span style="font-size:12px" x-text="turn.user"></span></div>
                        <div><span style="color:var(--accent);font-size:11px">AGENT: </span><span style="font-size:12px" x-text="turn.agent"></span></div>
                      </div>
                    </template>
                  </div>
                </td></tr>
              </template>
            </template>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Phase 2-A  실시간 모니터링
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="s-realtime" class="sec" x-show="sec==='realtime'" x-cloak>
  <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px">📡 Session Live Preview</div>
  <div style="color:var(--text2);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px">Sliding-window metrics for the current dev session — auto-refreshes every 15s · Development/validation phase only</div>

  <!-- 포지셔닝 안내 배너 (항상 표시) -->
  <div style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid #6366f1;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.7">
    <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">🔍 Purpose of this tab</div>
    <div>Quickly check TCR, latency, and error rate for the <strong>current execution session</strong> via sliding windows (1min/5min/1h) during development and validation.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
      🚀 For <strong>production real-time monitoring</strong>, use the Phoenix-based operations dashboard.
      <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">agent-eval monitor</code>
      — span tracing, distributed tracing, and real-time error detection
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 히스토리 모드 배너 -->
  <template x-if="realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.source === 'file_snapshot'">
    <div style="background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:11px;color:#92400e;margin-bottom:10px">
      📂 History mode — showing saved snapshot of selected file. For live data from the current session, run <code>StreamingEvaluator</code> with the server.
    </div>
  </template>

  <!-- 윈도우 선택 -->
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px">
    <template x-for="w in ['1m','5m','1h']" :key="w">
      <button class="btn" :class="realtimeWindow===w?'btn-primary':''" @click="realtimeWindow=w;loadRealtime()"
              x-text="w==='1m'?'1 min':w==='5m'?'5 min':'1 hour'"></button>
    </template>
    <button class="btn" @click="loadRealtime()">🔄 Refresh</button>
  </div>

  <template x-if="!realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.count">
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:48px;color:var(--text2)">
      <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px">📡</div>
      <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px">No live data</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px">Selecting a file displays the saved snapshot in history mode.</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text3)">Live data: <code>StreamingEvaluator</code> + <code>app.add_middleware(AgentEvalMiddleware)</code></div>
    </div>
  </template>

  <template x-if="realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.count > 0">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:8px">
      <div class="kpi"><div class="text-muted">Requests</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.count??0"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="text-muted">TCR</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981" x-text="(realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.tcr??0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="text-muted">Avg Latency</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.avg_latency??0).toFixed(2)+'s'"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="text-muted">P95 Latency</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.p95_latency??0).toFixed(2)+'s'"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="text-muted">Error Rate</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444" x-text="(realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.error_rate??0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="text-muted">Avg Tokens</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(realtimeStats[realtimeWindow]?.avg_tokens??0).toFixed(0)"></div></div>
    </div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Phase 2-B  알림 히스토리
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="s-alerts" class="sec" x-show="sec==='alerts'" x-cloak>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px">
    <div>
      <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px">🔔 Alert History</div>
      <div style="color:var(--text2);font-size:12px">
        AlertEngine rule trigger history — based on results/alerts/*.jsonl files
        <template x-if="alertData?.today?.date && selId">
          <span style="margin-left:6px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px;font-size:11px"
                x-text="'📂 ' + (alertData.today.date || 'Today')"></span>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" @click="loadAlerts()">🔄 Refresh</button>
  </div>

  <!-- 용도 안내 배너 -->
  <div style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid #6366f1;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.7">
    <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">🔍 Purpose of this tab</div>
    <div>Review the history of alerts fired by <strong>AlertEngine</strong> when preset thresholds (TCR, error rate, latency, etc.) are exceeded. Provides Critical/Warning severity classification, cooldown deduplication, and today/7-day trends.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
      🛠️ <strong>How to activate</strong>:
      Create an <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">AlertEngine</code> instance, register rules, then call it after
      <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">monitor.record_task()</code>.
      Alerts are auto-saved to <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">results/alerts/</code>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div x-data="{
    alertSelK: null,
    alertMeta: {
      today_total:  {label:'Today\'s Alerts', unit:'', desc:'Total count of AlertEngine rules fired today. Sum of Critical + Warning, aggregated from rule trigger history files (results/alerts/*.jsonl).'},
      today_critical:{label:'Critical', unit:'', desc:'Severe alerts requiring immediate action. Fired on conditions that directly impact the service: error rate spikes, SLA violations, budget overruns, etc.'},
      today_warning: {label:'Warning',  unit:'', desc:'Alerts requiring attention but not immediate action. Proactive monitoring signals such as performance degradation and approaching thresholds.'},
      total_7d:      {label:'7-Day Total', unit:'', desc:'Total alerts fired over the last 7 days. Used to track alert frequency trends and identify recurring patterns.'},
    },
    alertFormula(k, d) {
      const t = d.today || {}, sm = d.summary || {};
      if (k === 'today_total')   return `Today's alerts = Critical + Warning\n= ${t.critical??0} + ${t.warning??0} = ${t.total??0}`;
      if (k === 'today_critical')return `Critical alerts = ${t.critical??0}\nOf total: ${t.total>0?((t.critical/t.total)*100).toFixed(1):0}%\nRule: fired when severity=critical condition met`;
      if (k === 'today_warning') return `Warning alerts = ${t.warning??0}\nOf total: ${t.total>0?((t.warning/t.total)*100).toFixed(1):0}%\nRule: fired when severity=warning condition met`;
      if (k === 'total_7d')      return `7-day total = ${sm.total_7d??0}\nDaily avg: ${sm.total_7d>0?((sm.total_7d)/7).toFixed(1):0}/day`;
      return '';
    },
    alertItems(k, d) {
      const evs = d.today?.events || [];
      if (k === 'today_critical') return evs.filter(e=>e.severity==='critical');
      if (k === 'today_warning')  return evs.filter(e=>e.severity==='warning');
      if (k === 'total_7d')       return evs;
      return evs;
    }
  }">
    <!-- KPI 카드 -->
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:alertSelK==='today_total'}" @click="alertSelK=alertSelK==='today_total'?null:'today_total'">
        <div class="text-muted">Today's Alerts</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="alertData?.today?.total??0"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:alertSelK==='today_critical'}" @click="alertSelK=alertSelK==='today_critical'?null:'today_critical'">
        <div class="text-muted">Critical</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444" x-text="alertData?.today?.critical??0"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:alertSelK==='today_warning'}" @click="alertSelK=alertSelK==='today_warning'?null:'today_warning'">
        <div class="text-muted">Warning</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b" x-text="alertData?.today?.warning??0"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:alertSelK==='total_7d'}" @click="alertSelK=alertSelK==='total_7d'?null:'total_7d'">
        <div class="text-muted">7-Day Total</div>
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="alertData?.summary?.total_7d??0"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- KPI 상세 패널 -->
    <div x-show="alertSelK" style="margin:0 0 14px;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden" x-cloak>
      <template x-if="alertSelK && alertData">
        <div>
          <div class="panel-header">
            <span class="val-md" x-text="alertMeta[alertSelK]?.label||alertSelK"></span>
            <span class="tag-sm" x-text="alertMeta[alertSelK]?.unit?'Unit: '+alertMeta[alertSelK].unit:''"></span>
            <button class="btn-close" @click="alertSelK=null">×</button>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2-divider">
            <div class="panel-bg2-r">
              <div class="label-upper">Description</div>
              <div class="body-text" x-text="alertMeta[alertSelK]?.desc||''"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-bg3">
              <div class="label-upper">📐 Calculation</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-line" x-text="alertFormula(alertSelK, alertData)"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-bg">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
              <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase">Related Alerts</span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-left:auto" x-text="alertItems(alertSelK, alertData).length+' alerts'"></span>
            </div>
            <template x-if="alertItems(alertSelK, alertData).length === 0">
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);padding:8px 0">No alerts for this condition</div>
            </template>
            <div class="dtx" style="max-height:220px;overflow-y:auto">
              <template x-if="alertItems(alertSelK, alertData).length > 0">
                <div>
                  <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,1fr) 72px minmax(0,2fr) 160px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
                    <span>Rule Name</span><span>Severity</span><span>Message</span><span>Fired At</span>
                  </div>
                  <template x-for="ev in alertItems(alertSelK, alertData)" :key="ev.triggered_at">
                    <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,1fr) 72px minmax(0,2fr) 160px">
                      <span class="dtx-id" x-text="ev.rule_name"></span>
                      <span style="font-size:11px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap"
                            :style="ev.severity==='critical'?'background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444':'background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b'"
                            x-text="ev.severity"></span>
                      <span class="text-muted" x-text="ev.message?.substring(0,80)"></span>
                      <span class="text-muted" x-text="ev.triggered_at?.substring(0,19).replace('T',' ')"></span>
                    </div>
                  </template>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>

    <!-- 오늘 알림 목록 (KPI 카드 미선택 시에만 표시) -->
    <template x-if="!alertData?.today?.total">
      <div style="text-align:center;padding:48px;color:var(--text2)">
        <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px">🔔</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px">No alerts</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px">Set up <code>AlertEngine</code> and connect it to <code>StreamingEvaluator</code>.</div>
      </div>
    </template>

    <template x-if="alertData?.today?.events?.length > 0 && !alertSelK">
      <div class="kpi" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
        <div style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">Today's Alert List</div>
        <template x-for="ev in (alertData.today.events||[])" :key="ev.triggered_at">
          <div style="padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start">
            <span style="font-size:18px" x-text="ev.severity==='critical'?'🚨':'⚠️'"></span>
            <div style="flex:1">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px">
                <span style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px" x-text="ev.rule_name"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:10px"
                      :style="ev.severity==='critical'?'background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444':'background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b'"
                      x-text="ev.severity"></span>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="ev.message?.substring(0,200)"></div>
              <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px" x-text="ev.triggered_at"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Phase 2-C  사용자 반응 (암묵적 피드백)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="s-feedback" class="sec" x-show="sec==='feedback'" x-cloak>
  <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px">👍 User Reactions</div>
  <div style="color:var(--text2);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px">ImplicitFeedbackTracker — quality metrics based on implicit user behavior signals</div>

  <!-- 용도 안내 배너 -->
  <div style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid #6366f1;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.7">
    <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">🔍 Purpose of this tab</div>
    <div>Aggregates <strong>implicit user behaviors</strong> (like, dislike, copy, regenerate, abandon, share, correction) in response to agent outputs to measure user acceptance of response quality. Complements <em>perceived satisfaction</em> that automated metrics find difficult to capture.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
      🛠️ <strong>How to activate</strong>:
      <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">monitor.record_implicit_feedback(task_id, "thumbs_up")</code>
      — Signal types: <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">thumbs_up · thumbs_down · copy · regenerate · abandon · share · correction</code>
    </div>
  </div>

  <template x-if="!feedbackData?.total">
    <div style="text-align:center;padding:48px;color:var(--text2)">
      <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px">👍</div>
      <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px">No feedback data</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px">Record feedback using <code>monitor.record_implicit_feedback(task_id, "thumbs_up")</code>.</div>
    </div>
  </template>

  <template x-if="feedbackData?.total > 0">
    <div x-data="{
      fbSelK: null,
      fbMeta: {
        total:         {label:'Total Feedback', unit:'', desc:'Total user reaction events recorded by ImplicitFeedbackTracker. Sum of all types: thumbs_up, thumbs_down, copy, regenerate, abandon, share, correction, etc.'},
        positive_rate: {label:'Positive Rate', unit:'%', desc:'Proportion of positive signals (thumbs_up, copy, share, follow_up_depth) in total feedback. Higher values indicate greater user satisfaction with response quality.'},
        negative_rate: {label:'Negative Rate', unit:'%', desc:'Proportion of negative signals (thumbs_down, correction) in total feedback. A high rate signals a need to improve response accuracy or usefulness.'},
        regenerate_rate:{label:'Regenerate Rate', unit:'%', desc:'Rate at which users requested regeneration because they were unsatisfied with agent responses. A high rate suggests degraded response quality or a need for prompt design improvements.'},
        abandon_rate:  {label:'Abandon Rate', unit:'%', desc:'Rate at which users abandoned the conversation after an agent response. A high abandon rate may indicate that responses did not sufficiently meet user intent.'},
      },
      fbFormula(k, d) {
        if (k==='total')          return '= thumbs_up + thumbs_down + copy + regenerate + abandon + share + correction + ...\nsum of all event types';
        if (k==='positive_rate')  return '= (thumbs_up + copy + share + follow_up_depth) / total × 100';
        if (k==='negative_rate')  return '= (thumbs_down + correction) / total × 100';
        if (k==='regenerate_rate')return '= regenerate / total × 100';
        if (k==='abandon_rate')   return '= abandon / total × 100';
        return '';
      },
      fbItems(k, d) {
        const dist = d.type_distribution || {};
        if (k==='positive_rate')  return Object.entries(dist).filter(([t])=>['thumbs_up','copy','share','follow_up_depth'].includes(t));
        if (k==='negative_rate')  return Object.entries(dist).filter(([t])=>['thumbs_down','correction'].includes(t));
        if (k==='regenerate_rate')return Object.entries(dist).filter(([t])=>t==='regenerate');
        if (k==='abandon_rate')   return Object.entries(dist).filter(([t])=>t==='abandon');
        return Object.entries(dist);
      }
    }">
      <!-- KPI 카드 5개 -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:fbSelK==='total'}" @click="fbSelK=fbSelK==='total'?null:'total'">
          <div class="text-muted">Total Feedback</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="feedbackData.total"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px">▸ Detail</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:fbSelK==='positive_rate'}" @click="fbSelK=fbSelK==='positive_rate'?null:'positive_rate'">
          <div class="text-muted">Positive Rate</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981" x-text="(feedbackData.positive_rate||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px">▸ Detail</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:fbSelK==='negative_rate'}" @click="fbSelK=fbSelK==='negative_rate'?null:'negative_rate'">
          <div class="text-muted">Negative Rate</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444" x-text="(feedbackData.negative_rate||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px">▸ Detail</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:fbSelK==='regenerate_rate'}" @click="fbSelK=fbSelK==='regenerate_rate'?null:'regenerate_rate'">
          <div class="text-muted">Regenerate Rate</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b" x-text="(feedbackData.regenerate_rate||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px">▸ Detail</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:fbSelK==='abandon_rate'}" @click="fbSelK=fbSelK==='abandon_rate'?null:'abandon_rate'">
          <div class="text-muted">Abandon Rate</div>
          <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700" x-text="(feedbackData.abandon_rate||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px">▸ Detail</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 상세 패널 -->
      <div x-show="fbSelK" style="margin:0 0 14px;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden" x-cloak>
        <template x-if="fbSelK">
          <div>
            <div style="padding:10px 14px;background:var(--bg3);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
              <span class="val-md" x-text="fbMeta[fbSelK]?.label||fbSelK"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px" x-text="fbMeta[fbSelK]?.unit?'Unit: '+fbMeta[fbSelK].unit:''"></span>
              <button class="btn-close" @click="fbSelK=null">×</button>
            </div>
            <div style="padding:12px 16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:6px">Description</div>
                <div class="body-text" x-text="fbMeta[fbSelK]?.desc||''"></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:6px">Formula</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-line" x-text="fbFormula(fbSelK, feedbackData)"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="padding:0 16px 14px">
              <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
                <span>Related Type Distribution</span>
                <span class="tag-sm" x-text="fbItems(fbSelK, feedbackData).length+' types'"></span>
              </div>
              <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:6px">
                <template x-for="[type, count] in fbItems(fbSelK, feedbackData)" :key="type">
                  <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border)">
                    <div class="text-muted" x-text="type"></div>
                    <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700" x-text="count"></div>
                    <div class="text-xs-muted" x-text="feedbackData.total>0?((count/feedbackData.total*100).toFixed(1)+'%'):''"></div>
                  </div>
                </template>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>

      <!-- 전체 유형 분포 (카드 미선택 시) -->
      <template x-if="!fbSelK">
        <div class="kpi" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
          <div style="padding:10px 14px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
            <span>Feedback Type Distribution</span>
            <span class="tag-sm" x-text="Object.keys(feedbackData.type_distribution||{}).length+' types'"></span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:12px 14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(130px,1fr));gap:8px">
            <template x-for="[type, count] in Object.entries(feedbackData.type_distribution||{})" :key="type">
              <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px">
                <div class="text-muted" x-text="type"></div>
                <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700" x-text="count"></div>
                <div class="text-xs-muted" x-text="feedbackData.total>0?((count/feedbackData.total*100).toFixed(1)+'%'):''"></div>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Phase 3-B  이상 감지
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="s-anomaly" class="sec" x-show="sec==='anomaly'" x-cloak>
  <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px">🚨 Anomaly Detection</div>
  <div style="color:var(--text2);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px">AnomalyDetector — Z-score · IQR · linear regression-based anomaly pattern detection</div>

  <!-- 용도 안내 배너 -->
  <div style="background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid #6366f1;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.7">
    <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">🔍 About This Tab</div>
    <div>Analyzes individual task results as a <strong>time series</strong> to automatically detect statistically abnormal patterns. Unlike the Insights tab's threshold comparison, this tab captures <em>sudden changes in data flow</em> itself.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
      🛠️ <strong>How to Enable</strong>:
      <code style="background:var(--bg2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px">PerformanceMonitor(enable_anomaly_detection=True)</code>
      — Requires at least 30 task results.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 인사이트 탭과의 차이 안내 -->
  <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:12px">
    <div style="flex:1;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.25);background:rgba(99,102,241,.06)">
      <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">🚨 Anomaly Detection <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--text2)">(this tab)</span></div>
      <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6">
        Analyzes individual task results as a <strong>time series</strong> to detect statistically outlying patterns.<br>
        · <strong>Z-score</strong> — deviation beyond standard deviation from mean<br>
        · <strong>IQR</strong> — sudden spike outside interquartile range<br>
        · <strong>Linear Regression</strong> — trend deviation detection<br>
        · Detection types: ACCURACY_DRIFT · TOKEN_SPIKE · ERROR_SURGE · SECURITY_PATTERN<br>
        · Requires <code style="font-size:10.5px;background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px">enable_anomaly_detection=True</code>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,.25);background:rgba(234,179,8,.06)">
      <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">🔍 Insights Tab Anomaly Detection <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer" @click="sec='insights'">→ Go</span></div>
      <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6">
        Compares final aggregated metrics against <strong>preset thresholds</strong> to check for violations.<br>
        · <strong>Threshold-based</strong> — TCR · accuracy · hallucination · P95 latency · cost<br>
        · <strong>Z-score summary</strong> — metric deviation alerts (>2σ)<br>
        · Auto-calculated on result file load (no extra config needed)<br>
        · Includes recommendations, alerts, and bottleneck analysis
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Harness Gate G — 관측성 (Observability) -->
  <template x-if="data && data.harness_groups && data.harness_groups['G']">
    <div x-data="{
  gG: data.harness_groups['G'],
  selK:null,
  meta:{
    group_g:{label:'Gate G Overall',desc:'Weighted average gate of observability metrics (tool coverage·explainability·error diagnosis·latency attribution·observability score).',hint:'gate: pass≥0.75, warn≥0.6, fail<0.6'},
    tool_coverage:{label:'Tool Coverage',desc:'Tool call tracing coverage when ObservabilityConfig is set. Detects uninstrumented spans.',hint:'Traced tool calls / total | 🟢 ≥90% 🟡 ≥70% 🔴 <70%'},
    avg_explainability:{label:'Explainability',desc:'Score for presence of reasoning markers, uncertainty, and citations in responses when ExplainabilityConfig is set.',hint:'Reasoning+uncertainty+citation marker weighted sum | 🟢 ≥0.8 🟡 ≥0.6 🔴 <0.6'},
    avg_error_diagnosis:{label:'Error Diagnosis',desc:'Whether failed responses include the 3 elements (error acknowledgment, root cause, alternative suggestion) when ErrorDiagnosisConfig is set.',hint:'Acknowledgment×0.3 + RootCause×0.5 + Alternative×0.2 | 🟢 ≥0.8 🟡 ≥0.5 🔴 <0.5'},
    avg_latency_attribution:{label:'Latency Attribution Accuracy',desc:'Accuracy of decomposing total latency into tool/model/network/unattributed when LatencyAttributionConfig is set.',hint:'Warning if unattributed ratio >30% | 🟢 ≥0.8 🟡 ≥0.6 🔴 <0.6'},
    avg_observability_score:{label:'Observability Score',desc:'Composite of required span attribute coverage, trace continuity, and audit event SLO when ObservabilityConfig is set.',hint:'min_coverage achieved | 🟢 ≥0.9 🟡 ≥0.7 🔴 <0.7'},
  },
  formula(k,d){
    const g=d.harness_groups?.G||{};
    const dt=g.details||{};
    if(k==='group_g') return `Overall = ${(g.score||0)*100 .toFixed(1)}%\nGate: ${(g.gate||'?').toUpperCase()}`;
    const v=dt[k];
    if(v==null) return 'No data';
    return `${this.meta[k]?.label} = ${(v*100).toFixed(1)}%\nRaw value: ${v.toFixed(4)}`;
  }
}">
      <div class="sdiv"><div class="sdiv-line"></div><span class="sdiv-lbl">🔍 Harness Gate G — Observability</span><div class="sdiv-line"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='group_g'}" @click="selK=selK==='group_g'?null:'group_g'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Gate G Overall</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
               :style="`color:${gG.gate==='pass'?'var(--green)':gG.gate==='fail'?'var(--red)':'var(--yellow)'}`"
               x-text="gG.score!=null?(gG.score*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub"
               :class="gG.gate==='pass'?'ok':gG.gate==='fail'?'':'warn'"
               x-text="(gG.gate||'?').toUpperCase()"></div>
        </div>
        <!-- 도구 커버리지 -->
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='tool_coverage'}" @click="selK=selK==='tool_coverage'?null:'tool_coverage'" x-show="gG.details && gG.details.tool_coverage!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Tool Coverage</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
               :style="`color:${(gG.details?.tool_coverage||0)>=0.9?'var(--green)':(gG.details?.tool_coverage||0)>=0.7?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
               x-text="gG.details?.tool_coverage!=null?((gG.details.tool_coverage)*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub muted">Tool Coverage</div>
        </div>
        <!-- 설명가능성 — ExplainabilityConfig -->
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='avg_explainability'}" @click="selK=selK==='avg_explainability'?null:'avg_explainability'" x-show="gG.details && gG.details.avg_explainability!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Explainability</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
               :style="`color:${(gG.details?.avg_explainability||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(gG.details?.avg_explainability||0)>=0.6?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
               x-text="gG.details?.avg_explainability!=null?((gG.details.avg_explainability)*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub muted">Explainability</div>
        </div>
        <!-- 오류 진단 — ErrorDiagnosisConfig -->
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='avg_error_diagnosis'}" @click="selK=selK==='avg_error_diagnosis'?null:'avg_error_diagnosis'" x-show="gG.details && gG.details.avg_error_diagnosis!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Error Diagnosis</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
               :style="`color:${(gG.details?.avg_error_diagnosis||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(gG.details?.avg_error_diagnosis||0)>=0.6?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
               x-text="gG.details?.avg_error_diagnosis!=null?((gG.details.avg_error_diagnosis)*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub muted">ErrorDiagnosis</div>
        </div>
        <!-- 지연 귀속 — LatencyAttributionConfig -->
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='avg_latency_attribution'}" @click="selK=selK==='avg_latency_attribution'?null:'avg_latency_attribution'" x-show="gG.details && gG.details.avg_latency_attribution!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Latency Attribution Accuracy</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
               :style="`color:${(gG.details?.avg_latency_attribution||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(gG.details?.avg_latency_attribution||0)>=0.6?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
               x-text="gG.details?.avg_latency_attribution!=null?((gG.details.avg_latency_attribution)*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub muted">LatencyAttribution</div>
        </div>
        <!-- 관측성 점수 — ObservabilityConfig -->
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='avg_observability_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='avg_observability_score'?null:'avg_observability_score'" x-show="gG.details && gG.details.avg_observability_score!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Observability Score</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
               :style="`color:${(gG.details?.avg_observability_score||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(gG.details?.avg_observability_score||0)>=0.6?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
               x-text="gG.details?.avg_observability_score!=null?((gG.details.avg_observability_score)*100).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub muted">Observability</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div x-show="selK" style="margin-top:10px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px">
        <template x-if="selK">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text1)" x-text="meta[selK]?.label||selK"></div>
            <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px">
              <div style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px" x-text="meta[selK]?.desc||''"></div>
              <div style="font-size:11.5px;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px" x-text="formula(selK,data)"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);padding:6px 10px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:4px" x-text="meta[selK]?.hint||''"></div>
              <!-- 관련 태스크 -->
              <div style="margin-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:8px">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px">
                  <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase">Related Tasks</span>
                  <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(data.tasks||[]).length+' tasks'"></span>
                </div>
                <div x-show="!(data.tasks||[]).length" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center;padding:10px">
